//  Shared thinking-spinner sheet. Nine 16x16 cells: eight spinner frames and
//  one deliberately EMPTY cell.
//
//  The blank exists because the "none" state still has to draw SOMETHING. A
//  part state with no image is not a reliable way to hide a part, and the
//  drone animation already carries a note about "invisible" being mapped to a
//  visible frame -- this is that mistake's fix, made in advance.
//
//  <frame> is 1-indexed in .animation files, so spin.1 .. spin.8 is what a
//  "frames" : 8 state expands to. Do not renumber from zero.

{
  "frameGrid" : {
    "size" : [16, 16],
    "dimensions" : [9, 1],
    "names" : [
      [ "spin.1", "spin.2", "spin.3", "spin.4",
        "spin.5", "spin.6", "spin.7", "spin.8", "blank" ]
    ]
  }
}
